B.aG3=new A.yn("ATS based Kerr-Cat Qubit","Participated in the research, design and development of **Asymmetrically Threaded SQUIDs (ATS)**-based Superconducting Kerr Cat Qubits. As a Sub-Team Lead, of **Qiskit-Metal, Ansys HFSS, Q3D, and KQLayout** for quantum circuit development. Under the supervision of **Dr. Shantanu Jha https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=CKj1TYUAAAAJ&hl=en&authuser=3** and **Mr. Muhammad Waqar Amin https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Muhammad-Waqar-Amin**. ",u.E,B.asL,null)
